  "comments": [
    {"at":0,"placement":"line","text":"Does one step of the effects of each voice: pitch steps, pulse sweep and frequency slide, in 3 phases."},
    {"at":2,"placement":"side","text":"Bit 7 clear: the effects of the voice are off."},
    {"at":7,"placement":"side","text":"Waits until the effect delay is 0."},
    {"at":12,"placement":"side","text":"Length 0, or all steps done: goes to the next phase."},
    {"at":46,"placement":"line","text":"Goes to the next of the 3 phases. After phase 2, loops only when flag bit 3 is set."},
    {"at":103,"placement":"line","text":"Flag bit 6: adds the step value to the pitch of voice X and sets the frequency from the table at $9ebb."},
    {"at":117,"placement":"side","text":"Keeps the pitch below $c0."},
    {"at":175,"placement":"line","text":"Flag bit 5: adds the step value times 16 to the pulse width of voice X."},
    {"at":223,"placement":"line","text":"Flag bit 4: adds the step value to the frequency of voice X. Bit 7 of the phase length makes the step negative."},
    {"at":265,"placement":"line","text":"Does one step of the filter sweep: adds the step of the phase to the cutoff, in 3 phases."},
    {"at":267,"placement":"side","text":"Speed 0: no sweep."},
    {"at":291,"placement":"line","text":"After phase 2, the sweep starts again only when the step of phase 1 is not 0."},
    {"at":320,"placement":"line","text":"Adds the step of the filter phase to the 11-bit cutoff, then sets the cutoff."},
    {"at":340,"placement":"line","text":"Writes the 11-bit cutoff filter_cutoff to the SID shadow (low 3 bits, high 8 bits)."}
  ],
